# Career bench in the city: from a loaded story save, the player is put on a road in Downtown
# Broker (open from the start of the story; Algonquin stays closed until later), given a car, and the game's own driving AI takes it through
# the streets (TASK_CAR_DRIVE_WANDER) with traffic and pedestrians around. Fixed noon, sunny, no
# wanted level, invincible. Run through tools/perf/route_bench.sh pad (a copy of the save; never
# saved), which cuts frames.csv at these marks: city (the whole drive) and w1..w6 (30 s each).
await 5m
# The fade-in after the load and the phone/help text settle.
wait 10s
nowanted
invincible
clock 13 0
weather 1
road 1040 150 20
car sultan
wait 4s
mark settle
drive 16 0
nowanted
wait 15s
mark settle_end
mark city
mark w1
shot {out}/shots/city-000.png 0.5
wait 30s
mark w1_end
mark w2
shot {out}/shots/city-030.png 0.5
wait 30s
mark w2_end
mark w3
shot {out}/shots/city-060.png 0.5
wait 30s
mark w3_end
mark w4
shot {out}/shots/city-090.png 0.5
wait 30s
mark w4_end
mark w5
shot {out}/shots/city-120.png 0.5
wait 30s
mark w5_end
mark w6
shot {out}/shots/city-150.png 0.5
wait 30s
mark w6_end
mark city_end
shot {out}/shots/city-180.png 0.5
wait 1s
quit
